-- O-Car rules, Article 7 (loss assessment), Article 8 (the claim file), Article 9 (double
-- insurance) and Article 10 (time limits for claims, complaints and suits). Quotations are
-- generated from ../../source/raw/opes-ocar.txt.

§ `Article 7 — Loss assessment`

-- The Insurer, or someone it authorises, assesses the cause and the extent of the damage, in a
-- written report signed by those taking part; the Insurer bears the cost of its assessment.
-- src:395 | Điều 7: Giám định tổn thất
