@ref O-Car rules, Article 10 (src:543-545)
GIVEN `the date the dispute arose` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`10 — the last day to sue, the dispute having arisen on` `the date the dispute arose` MEANS
    `add years` `the date the dispute arose` 3

-- Disputes not settled by negotiation go to a competent court in Vietnam (no arbitration).
-- Inert: the forum is the answer, and it has no condition.
